* Tue Nov 10 2026 molan <59296158+molan-git@users.noreply.github.com> - 0.9.0-1
- [add] Custom sounds feature
- [add] Solfeggio frequencies feature
- [add] Play up to 3 ambient sounds together
- [add] Custom binaural frequencies
- [add] Wave generator with colored noises
- [improvement] TimerPage, MainPage, CoverPage, AboutPage UI
- [improvement] UI decomposition
- [improvement] Ambient sound channel hardening, better loops & loudness compensation
- [refactoring] Audio engines and generators
- [fix] Unstable ambient sound crossfade / fade-out

* Wed Oct 14 2026 molan <59296158+molan-git@users.noreply.github.com> - 0.8.1-1
- [add] new ambience sounds: Waves & Sailing (updated Lake)
- [enhancement] Pauses the timer during audio playback
- [translations] Added and updated Norwegian, Swedish, and Dutch translations (thanks for the contributions!)
- [refactoring] Prepared interface for additional features, cleaned up audioengine code
- [fix] Fixed missing translations in playback bar and cover page
- [improvement] Updated the audio engine
